# OPUS GUBERNATIO PARTICIPANT PACKAGE og-participant-2026.08-v6
#
# SUCCESSOR to og-participant-2026.08-v5, whose checksum record is preserved unchanged at
# code_audit/run30_participant_package_v5_checksums.sha256 and is now pinned to the commit whose
# blobs it describes. This record describes the LIVE TREE.
#
# WHY A SUCCESSOR. Run 31 Pass 2 propagated the six owner-approved Category-8 names to every
# current surface. Eight participant-visible files carry a module display name and therefore
# moved:
#
#     assets/js/categories.js            assets/js/decision-ui.js
#     assets/js/deepdive.js              assets/js/ds_defensibility_data.js
#     assets/js/ds_defensibility_evidence.js
#     assets/js/knowledge.js             assets/js/taxonomy.js
#     assets/js/workspace.js
#
# WHAT CHANGED IN THEM, EXACTLY. Six display names and nothing else:
#
#     ABM Governance Layer            -> Agent-Based Governance Model
#     FAR Threshold Monitor           -> FAR/Agency EVMS Applicability Monitor
#     OMB A-11 Check                  -> Versioned A-11 Capital Programming Conformance Check
#     EVM Reporting Threshold         -> EVMS Reporting Compliance Monitor
#     Contract Modification Frequency -> Contract Modification Governance Check
#     Contractor Performance Score    -> Contractor Performance Assessment Signal
#
# 8.1 is `Agent-Based Governance Model` and expressly NOT `Action Boundary & Authority Matrix`:
# the matrix is the governed policy the model consults and is not a registered module. No
# Bayesian terminology is introduced anywhere.
#
# THE EXPERIMENTAL SEQUENCE IS UNCHANGED. No threshold, no evidence-review step, no preliminary
# assessment, no preliminary lock, no AI reveal, no final action/confidence/disposition capture,
# no final lock and no period advancement moved. The delta is a string substitution on display
# names and is inverse-mappable: applying the six reverse substitutions to these eight files
# reproduces the v5 bytes exactly, which the package suite asserts.
#
# The v5 record is NOT regenerated. It is pinned to the commit whose blobs it describes, which is
# the defect the Run-28 closure had to correct in the v2 record and which must never recur.
